{"name":"Quixotic","hex":"#948491","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Quixotic","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Alternative letter-case form of quixotic."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Quixotic"}],"entries":[{"title":"Quixotism","blocks":[{"text":"Quixotism is impracticality in pursuit of ideals, especially those ideals manifested by rash, lofty and romantic ideas or extravagantly chivalrous action. It also serves to describe an idealism without regard to practicality. An impulsive person or act might be regarded as quixotic."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Don_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg/330px-Don_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quixotism","wikidata":"Q2919914"},{"title":"Quixotic (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Quixotic is the debut studio album by English singer-songwriter Martina Topley-Bird. The album spans several musical styles including trip hop, electronica and rock. It was co-written and produced by Topley-Bird and received positive reviews from music critics upon its release and was shortlisted for the 2003 Mercury Music Prize. Quixotic also includes a collaboration with musician Tricky, with whom Topley-Bird collaborated prior to her solo work."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/eb/Martina_topley-bird_quixotic.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quixotic_(album)","wikidata":"Q1943188"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Don_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg/500px-Don_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Don_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg/1280px-Don_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Don_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg/500px-Don_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Illustration by Gustave Doré depicting the windmill scene of Don Quixote, in which the hero fights with windmills, which he imagines to be giants.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADon_Quijote_Illustration_by_Gustave_Dore_VII.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/eb/Martina_topley-bird_quixotic.jpg/250px-Martina_topley-bird_quixotic.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/eb/Martina_topley-bird_quixotic.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/eb/Martina_topley-bird_quixotic.jpg/250px-Martina_topley-bird_quixotic.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMartina_topley-bird_quixotic.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/ab/MTB_Anything.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/ab/MTB_Anything.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMTB_Anything.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}